# Typeform
**Domain:** https://www.typeform.com

Typeform is a conversational form builder specializing in online forms, surveys, quizzes, and polls. Founded in 2012 and based in Barcelona, it pioneered the one-question-at-a-time format, which the company says doubles completion rates compared to traditional forms and drives 3.5x more data collection with AI assistance. Over 150,000 businesses use Typeform worldwide, including 95% of the Fortune 500. Its product suite spans AI-assisted form building, AI-moderated market research (Research Flow), and automated lead enrichment and conversion workflows (Growth Flow).

